{"sessionId":"3f83e8","location":"RichEditableLine:onInput","message":"onInput-commit","data":{"id":"nb-49","plain":"Files changedsrc/components/notebook/MathInputToolbar.tsxsrc/components/notebook/MathEditableParagraph.tsxsrc/components/project-space/ProjectNotebookBlock.tsxrichSelectionToolbarActive and desk syncSelectionToolbar early-return are unchanged.Code changesA — Wider toolbar focus guardMathInputToolbar.tsx: Moved data-math-input-toolbar=\"1\", role=\"toolbar\", and aria-label from desk-math-palette__tray to the desk-math-palette root so the hint line is inside the guarded region.MathEditableParagraph.tsx: On blur, also skip exiting edit mode when focus goes to .desk-math-palette.B — handleSurfaceBlur caret preservationProjectNotebookBlock.tsx: In handleSurfaceBlur, return early when relatedTarget is inside [data-math-input-toolbar] or .desk-math-palette. Removed pendingCaretRef.current = null so popover unmount does not cancel a pending caret restore after insert.C — Focus/caret restore after math insertProjectNotebookBlock.tsx: Added scheduleMathLineFocus(blockId, offset) — sets surfaceFocusBlockId, schedules pendingCaretRef, then double-requestAnimationFrame focus + setCaretOffsetIn on the line (runs after popover teardown).Wired from:insertMathSnippet (all paths, including math blocks)applyMathTemplate (including math blocks that previously returned without restore)Build resultsCommandResultnpm run buildExit 0npx tsc --noEmitExit 0Manual paths that should now passPathExpectedA — Type y=x^2, click palette hint, keep typingStays in edit mode; caret remains in lineB — Focus line → ▾ customize → Insert → type immediatelyCaret restored on line after popover closesB′ — Popover Cancel or click outside, then typeLine still editable after refocus click (or focus if still on line)C — Tap fraction/√/symbol (no ▾) → continue typingInsert + typing without extra clickRegression — Desk typing with no toolbar useStill worksRegression — ⌘↵ Check lineUnchangedRegression — Classic notebook text selection toolbarrichSelectionToolbarActive still desk-only off","suppressed":false,"programmatic":false,"toolbarGuard":false,"ignoreBlock":false},"hypothesisId":"D","runId":"pre-fix","timestamp":1780307259824}
